OL,3,GNEWSAMotorbike ride marks 614 days in
OL,4,AIran prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe detention of a couple held in Iran
OL,7,F"should shock people" as their time
OL,8,Fbeing held reaches over 600 days, their
OL,9,Ffamily has said.
OL,11,FThe family of Craig and Lindsay Foreman
OL,12,Fsaid the wait for the couple to be
OL,13,Freturned has been "an incredibly long
OL,14,Ftime", after they were detained in
OL,15,FJanuary 2025 while on a motorbiking
OL,16,Ftrip in Iran.
OL,18,FSupporters marked 614 days since their
OL,19,Fdetention on Wednesday by taking part
OL,20,Fin a motorbike ride through London and
OL,21,Fdelivering a letter to the Iranian
OL,22,Fembassy.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
